      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么，我去消化一下傍晚用的训练课表。\n会控制好不去影响到明天行程。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36059b67b5fa4f82619a7b8df09093ecdc521cb85c3d50a06d7cf7ec932c4d33",
