      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光潇洒地奔驰起来，\n态度可说是泰然自若。\n她真的变强了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeb6035deee5384d887cf4d5b6155bd9ed2c88ef3ca96c76d1f1818fd0f3f9a1",
