      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了让她以万全的状态\n挑战“宝冢纪念”，接下来应该──",
      "source_fingerprint": "50eaf92abbf7105177b2e1bbd1bd38fd0f04a441db1964eaed024de91790f815",
