      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也不能就这样保持沉默吗……\n但接下来要去无法沉默的地方就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "793e9834dfb03a02495e382eb35742250b5b7056374687ed25857539dafb6d48",
