      "uid": "zhcn:5196f292b8417b53695be6f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "明明才刚开完记者会，\n但记者们的气势丝毫没有衰退，\n我被接连不断的提问轰炸到晚上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17b7c7102ab7f960ff31b2c293db8cdc8e2887c7416f6b65e8ee3e869eef6fbf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
