      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……但不愧是赛马娘记者，\n他们拥有许多其他参赛者的详细情报和预测。",
      "source_fingerprint": "394ad5016e7e8e57a5061de5140f2548d5cafab27a9846981149ed4adb5cd627",
